      "id": 481228,
      "username": "sfarbod",
      "name": "Sfarbod",
      "created_at": "2025-09-20T10:50:16.461Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have a journal entry for the first accounting period that contains <strong>2,000 rows</strong>. When trying to submit the document, I receive the following error, even though there is no file attachment — only a large number of rows:</p>\n<h4><a name=\"p-481228-h-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-481228-h-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a></h4>\n<p>Bulk Operation Failed</p>\n<h2><a name=\"p-481228-file-size-exceeded-the-maximum-allowed-size-of-50-mb-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-481228-file-size-exceeded-the-maximum-allowed-size-of-50-mb-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>File size exceeded the maximum allowed size of 50 MB</h2>\n<p>Failed to delete 1 documents: MAT-DN-2025-00010</p>\n<p>Could you please help me understand what might be causing this error and how to fix it?</p>\n<p>Thank you.</p>\n<p>Request URL</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://10.50.150.10:8080/api/method/frappe.desk.form.save.savedocs\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://10.50.150.10:8080/api/method/frappe.desk.form.save.savedocs</a></p>\n<p>erpnext version 15</p>",
