      "id": 481229,
      "username": "sfarbod",
      "name": "Sfarbod",
      "created_at": "2025-09-20T11:21:55.416Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have a document in which I imported <strong>2,000 rows</strong> using the import tool. However, when I edit the document and try to save it, I receive the following error:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>File too big<br>\nFile size exceeded the maximum allowed size of 50 MB</p>\n</blockquote>",
